{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269IbcEYKQ0p1792750130.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一間汽車服務公司申請輸入外勞時違反規定，被勞工處行政制裁。</p><p></p><p>涉事的港深車業服務有限公司，透過「補充勞工優化計劃」申請輸入駕駛員，但勞工處指公司在本地公開招聘時，無合理理由下，無按已同意的安排面見一名合資格求職者，並提交不實的本地公開招聘結果。處方即時中止處理港深車業的輸入勞工申請，亦會拒絕處理隨後兩年的申請。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:34.469943+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:38:26.871450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:17.759096+00:00","content_hash":"e9224da1baae3eb993066886731ef6108e186ce53ff5bc3b3351ff305561f72b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:34.469943+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}